You are building a fully interactive, single-file React artifact (.jsx) 
that serves as an executive and client demo for ACM-AI — a Victorian 
Government compliance system that converts Asbestos Register PDFs into 
BAR-compliant spreadsheets using AI.

This artifact is a DEMO PRESENTATION for: Directors, CTO, CEO, and Clients.
It must be visually stunning, technically accurate, and fully interactive.

---

## BRANDING (VAEA Government)

Primary teal:   #3a8f8a   (approx oklch 0.52 0.09 185)
Accent coral:   #d4614a   (approx oklch 0.65 0.14 15)
Navy:           #2a2f45   (approx oklch 0.27 0.04 260)
Background:     #f4f7f9
Card bg:        #ffffff
Success:        #4caf82
Warning:        #f59e0b
Risk High:      #ef4444
Risk Medium:    #f97316
Risk Low:       #22c55e

Use Tailwind utility classes only. No custom CSS. Use inline styles 
only for oklch values where Tailwind doesn't cover them.

---

## TECHNOLOGY STACK (use these imports only)

import { useState, useEffect, useRef } from "react"
import { 
  Upload, FileText, Database, Table, MessageSquare, Download, 
  CheckCircle, AlertTriangle, TrendingUp, Building, Search, 
  ChevronRight, ChevronDown, Zap, Shield, BarChart3, Eye,
  ArrowRight, Play, Loader, Settings, Users, Award
} from "lucide-react"
import { 
  BarChart, Bar, LineChart, Line, PieChart, Pie, Cell,
  XAxis, YAxis, CartesianGrid, Tooltip, Legend, ResponsiveContainer 
} from "recharts"

---

## STRUCTURE

Build a single-page application with a LEFT SIDEBAR navigation and 
a MAIN CONTENT area. The sidebar has these nav sections:

1. 🏠 Overview          — Hero + project summary
2. 🔄 Pipeline          — 7-Stage extraction flow (animated)
3. 📊 Spreadsheet       — AG Grid demo mockup
4. 💬 Chat              — AI chat demo with ACM citations
5. 📤 Export            — BAR export preview
6. 📈 Progress          — Sprint/epic/story progress dashboard
7. 🏗️ Architecture      — Technical system diagram
8. 👥 Stakeholders      — Audience-specific value summaries

The active section renders in the main content area. Default to Overview.

---

