## SECTION 2: PIPELINE

Title: "7-Stage Extraction Pipeline"
Subtitle: "From raw PDF to structured compliance data"

Show an ANIMATED pipeline diagram. Each stage is a pill/card that 
lights up in sequence when the user clicks "Run Demo".

The 7 stages are:

Stage -1: PRE-ANALYSIS
  Icon: Search
  Color: navy
  Description: "TOC extraction, building inventory compilation, 
                page-level section tagging, document metadata enhancement"
  Tools: "LangGraph agentic orchestrator"

Stage 0: PREFLIGHT  
  Icon: FileText
  Color: teal
  Description: "PDF classifier detects digital vs scanned. 
                Parser router selects MinerU or Docling based on content type."
  Tools: "PDF Classifier → Parser Router"

Stage 0.5: ORCHESTRATION
  Icon: Zap
  Color: coral
  Description: "Agentic orchestrator routes each page section to 
                optimal extraction tool. MinerU for complex tables, 
                Docling for text/layout."
  Tools: "MinerU (primary) | Docling (fallback)"

Stage 1: EXTRACT (Verbatim with Provenance)
  Icon: Database
  Color: teal
  Description: "Raw table extraction preserving bounding boxes, 
                page numbers, merged cells, and multi-page stitching."
  Tools: "MineruTableExtractor | Docling | Generic Configurable Parser"

Stage 2: INTERPRET
  Icon: BarChart3
  Color: navy
  Description: "AI maps raw extracted cells to 47 BAR field schema. 
                Wording normalisation, enum validation, product classification 
                (T1–T8 taxonomy)."
  Tools: "LLM + register_row.schema.json + register_enums.json"

Stage 2.5: VALIDATE (Corrective RAG Loop)
  Icon: Shield
  Color: coral
  Description: "Validates enum fields against BAR controlled vocabulary. 
                Up to 3 LLM correction attempts for invalid values. 
                Tracks correction stats."
  Tools: "ValidationIssue → CorrectionStats → LLM re-extraction"

Stage 3: SAVE & INDEX
  Icon: CheckCircle
  Color: success
  Description: "Deduplication with SHA-256 composite keys. 
                Contextual embeddings for vector search. 
                ACMRecord + ACMTableSection persisted to SurrealDB."
  Tools: "SurrealDB | Vector embeddings | Parent Document Retrieval"

Below the pipeline, show a DATA FLOW diagram as a horizontal arrow chain:
PDF Upload → MinerU/Docling → ACM Parser → SurrealDB acm_record → AG Grid → BAR Export
Each box is a rounded card with icon. Arrows between them.

Below that, show a LIVE LOG SIMULATION panel (dark terminal style):
When "Run Demo" is clicked, show scrolling log lines appearing one by one:
  [Stage -1] Extracting TOC... found 3 sections
  [Stage 0]  PDF classified as: digital (non-scanned)
  [Stage 0.5] Routing page 1-4 → MinerU (complex tables detected)
  [Stage 1]  Extracted 3 tables, 47 rows, 12 merged cells
  [Stage 2]  Mapped 47 fields. Product classification: 31 non-friable, 16 friable
  [Stage 2.5] Validation: 3 enum errors corrected via RAG loop
  [Stage 3]  Saved 44 ACM records to SurrealDB. Embeddings indexed.
  ✅ Extraction complete in 18.3s
Use setTimeout/setInterval for the animation. Green text on dark bg.

